msgid ""
"... Gggrrrrmbbbthhh ggggrrrmmmbbttthh grrmbbtthh...\n"
"Who's there?\n"
"...\n"
"What are these vile bugs doing in my sacred forest?!\n"
"I hate them you know, and you look very similar to them. You're tiny and "
"your eyes... beady little things.\n"
"...Gggggggrreeerrmbbbthhhhhhhhh...\n"
"Be gone! I want nothing to do with you!\n"
"...Gggrrrrmbbbthhhhhhhhh...\n"
"But...\n"
"...Gggrrrrmbbbtttttttttttthhh...\n"
"I see you have a sword... Maybe...\n"
"...Grrrrrrttt...\n"
"Can you help me?"
msgstr ""

